  NSSADMIN to help you administer NSS's and DCSS's                              
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  Main panel                                                                    
                                                                                
  A display of all NSS's/DCSS's and their                                       
                                                                                
  Function keys:                                                                
                                                                                
   1. Help             - Displays this panel                                    
   2. Backup           - Creates a DCCSBKUP of the NSS/DCSS on that line        
   3. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
   4. Users            - Shows the users of the selected item                   
   5. Date             - Shows the date of the selected item                    
   6. Alldate          - Shows the dates of all items                           
   7. Restore          - Goes to the panel where a restore can be selected      
   8.                  -                                                        
   9. Purge            - Purge the selected item from spool                     
  10. Newdef           - Create a new item from scratch                         
  11. Copydef          - Copy the definitions of an item for a new one          
  12. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  Restore panel                                                                 
                                                                                
  Displays the items for which a backup was made                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  Restore panel                                                                 
                                                                                
   1. Help             - Displays this panel                                    
   2. Restore          - Restore a DCCSBKUP of the NSS/DCSS on that line        
  ...                                                                           
   3. Return           - Return to the main panel                               
  ...                                                                           
  12. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  Newdef panel                                                                  
                                                                                
  Select "Saved System" or "Saved Segment" and press ENTER                      
                                                                                
  Function keys:                                                                
                                                                                
   1. Help             - Displays this panel                                    
  ...                                                                           
   3. Return           - Return to the main panel                               
  ...                                                                           
  12. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  DCSS/NSS panel                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Fill in the desired values in the fields and press                            
                                                                                
  Function keys:                                                                
                                                                                
   1. Help             - Displays this panel                                    
  ...                                                                           
   3. Return           - Return to the main panel                               
  ...                                                                           
   3. Define&Load      - Define the SEGMENT and Load it                         
  ...                                                                           
   9. Check            - Checks the entries                                     
  10. Define           - Issue the DEFSEG                                       
  ...                                                                           
  12. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
                                                                                
  CopyDef panel                                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Fill in the desired values in the fields and press                            
                                                                                
  Function keys:                                                                
                                                                                
   1. Help             - Displays this panel                                    
  ...                                                                           
   3. Return           - Return to the main panel                               
  ...                                                                           
   9. Create           - Issue the DEFSEG command                               
  ...                                                                           
  12. Quit             - Exits the code                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
